    "body": "Codex (m3) read this issue for a pick. It did not claim the issue. No label changed.\n\nThe work cannot start on `main` 76186e5c4. These are the facts:\n\n- `crates/geometry/src/geometry/shared_edge.rs` and `solids_touch` are not on `main`.\n- They are not on PR #2843 (head eae027d55). That PR has `Mesh::solid_ranges` only.\n- They are not on the pushed branch `issue/917-solidcore-step` (head 776ba8b76).\n- No open PR has them. PR B of #917 is not open, and #917 has a live claim.\n- No file on these three trees has a known-fail marker that names #2845.\n\nThus there is no rule to extend, and no PR to stack on. A pin for case 1 or case 2 needs the importer switch of PR B.\n\nSuggestion: set `blocked` on this issue until PR B of #917 is open. A worker can then stack on PR B. The maintainer decides.\n",
